- follow the instructions in rebuild_jar/README; the build applies one of two alternative
  AJAX.js patches, and rebuild_jar/README.IIS explains when the IIS variant is needed
- then run buildArtifact.sh to assemble the artifacts
- to rebuild the artifacts, go into the richfaces-impl and richfaces-ui directories and run 'mvn clean package'
- to publish them on Maven Central run 'mvn clean deploy' instead: this is restricted to
  Link.it maintainers, as it requires the GPG signing key and the Maven Central token
